      "publishedAt": null,
      "observedAt": "2026-09-12T07:31:46.588Z",
      "firstObservedAt": "2026-09-12T07:31:46.588Z",
      "text": "La primera pantalla de Posts mostro un fijado de mayo y publicaciones del 9/9 y anteriores; no mostro un post de Box-on-Wheels.",
      "kind": "bounded-profile-coverage",
      "textBasis": "paraphrase"
    },
    {
